<h2 id="shortlist">The shortlist</h2>
<p>Pathology AI is not one product. Some tools look for cancer on a slide, some are slide-viewing platforms with AI built in, and some score stains such as HER2 or PD-L1. Compare within a category. Regulatory status below is what the vendor states or what appears on the FDA list; it varies by product and by country, and many AI modules from the same vendor are research use only.</p>
